Why Use WebSockets?
1. Real-Time Communication

Data reaches users immediately.

Example:

User A: Hello
User B receives instantly.
2. Persistent Connection

Connection stays open.

No need to reconnect repeatedly.

3. Lower Latency

Messages travel faster because:

No repeated HTTP handshakes.
No repeated TCP connections.
4. Less Network Overhead

Only one connection is maintained.

Hence:

Less bandwidth usage.
Better performance.